    "titleZh": "配合會議安排換房",
    "topic": "daily",
    "passage": "Woman: The street noise kept me awake. My online meeting is at two this afternoon. Then I’ll be out until five.\nMan: A quieter room will be ready at three. Our workroom is open from one to three.\nWoman: I’ll move. I’ll leave both bags here, but I need the red one when I return.\nMan: Tag each bag you want moved. Your new key is at reception until five, then at the night desk.",
    "passageZh": "女：街上的噪音害我睡不著。今天下午兩點有線上會議，之後我會出門，到五點才回來。\n男：比較安靜的房間三點會準備好。我們的工作室一點到三點開放。\n女：那我換房。兩件行李都先放這裡，不過我回來時需要紅色那件。\n男：需要搬到新房間的行李，請各掛一張標籤。新房卡五點前在接待櫃檯，之後到夜間櫃檯領。",
    "audioScript": "The street noise kept me awake. My online meeting is at two this afternoon. Then I’ll be out until five.\nA quieter room will be ready at three. Our workroom is open from one to three.\nI’ll move. I’ll leave both bags here, but I need the red one when I return.\nTag each bag you want moved. Your new key is at reception until five, then at the night desk.",
